Description: Terminal with a live Claude Code session list
 A GTK4 terminal that shows every running Claude Code session in a sidebar,
 with the status each one reports: waiting on you, busy, running a shell
 command, or idle. The distinction matters -- a tab title can only say
 "working" or "not working", while "waiting" means it is blocked on you.
 .
 The terminal inherits your GNOME Terminal profile verbatim, so colours, font
 and scrollback match the terminal you already use. Sessions that were open
 when the app last stopped are offered back, and Claude conversations resume
 where they left off.
